{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wukong UP</i> is a multiplayer online linked adventure game where you play as Wukong, who has been kidnapped by &quot;space robots&quot;. You'll go through 81 trials to break out of the cage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Countless fun level gameplay modes, all in one game to satisfy you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just a simple parkour game. During the gameplay, you can experience numerous modes including but not limited to jump games, sliding, and chase battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all these gameplay modes can be enjoyed in <i>Wukong UP</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.poster.avif?t=1755483215\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.webm?t=1755483215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.mp4?t=1755483215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wukong vs. Space Robots!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to do when facing the robots that kidnapped you? Of course, beat them up! Whether it's the Golden Cudgel or &quot;American Iai&quot;, you can use whatever you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's said that consecutive kills can increase your media rating?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.poster.avif?t=1755483215\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.webm?t=1755483215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.mp4?t=1755483215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheongsam, swimsuit, twin tails? A variety of distinctive characters to choose from!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >72 transformations \u2013 whether it's the four of Tang Seng's disciples, or a wave of popular beautiful girls, Wukong can fulfill your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.poster.avif?t=1755483215\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.webm?t=1755483215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.mp4?t=1755483215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820450?t=1755483215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755483215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/27def49f4ea905e8fbedf73717251a0ee12828bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755483215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/27def49f4ea905e8fbedf73717251a0ee12828bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755483215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2945430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Contact</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c514daf17eda5904c55db0618c6e6a53.avif?t=1755483215\" width=512 height=128 /></span><br>This game is in the public testing stage and we will actively listen to the opinions of players for improvement and refinement game.<br>If you like this game,please add wishlist!Thank you for your support.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wukong UP</i> is a multiplayer online linked adventure game where you play as Wukong, who has been kidnapped by &quot;space robots&quot;. You'll go through 81 trials to break out of the cage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Countless fun level gameplay modes, all in one game to satisfy you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just a simple parkour game. During the gameplay, you can experience numerous modes including but not limited to jump games, sliding, and chase battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all these gameplay modes can be enjoyed in <i>Wukong UP</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.poster.avif?t=1755483215\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.webm?t=1755483215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s